        "name": "USN-5967-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that the set() method in object-path could be corrupted as a result of prototype pollution by sending a message to the parent process. An attacker could use this issue to cause object-path to crash. (CVE-2020-15256, CVE-2021-23434, CVE-2021-3805)",
